	<string>Kronos reads the Apple Notes you choose so it can turn them into tasks and give a task its context. Nothing is changed in Notes and nothing leaves this Mac unless you use an online AI model.</string>
	<key>NSCalendarsFullAccessUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Kronos reads your calendar to show how much free time today has. Nothing leaves this Mac.</string>
	<key>NSHumanReadableCopyright</key>
	<string>© 2026 Marketing by Bešić</string>
	<key>NSSupportsAutomaticTermination</key>
	<false/>
	<key>NSSupportsSuddenTermination</key>
	<false/>
</dict>
</plist>
